>
>     Count[i] ~ dpois(eCount[ii] * eDispersion[ii])
>   }
> }
>
>
> The key feature is that the alpha = beta in the gamma distribution so
> that it has an expectation of 1.
>
> Any help or guidance would be greatly appreciated
>
> Joe
