> > >   TopologyException: Input geom 0 is invalid: Too few points in geometry component at or near point 11.098593709999999 64.963043209999995 at 11.098593709999999 64.963043209999995
> > > In addition: Warning message:
> > > In RGEOSBinTopoFunc(spgeom1, spgeom2, byid, id, drop_lower_td, "rgeos_intersection") :
> > >   spgeom1 and spgeom2 have different proj4 strings
> > >
> > > Firstly I thought that this error could be due to the fact that de square polygons hasn't any projection. However, even setting a projection to it, the error message still persists.
