aah,

you have to move

list(hyper = list(prec.unstruct = list(prior = sdunif),
                  prec.spatial = list(prior = sdunif))),

into the f() term

f(ID, model = "bym", graph = g,
  hyper = list(hyper = list(prec.unstruct = list(prior = sdunif),
                  prec.spatial = list(prior = sdunif))))

you are trying to set prior parameters in the poisson, which does not
work. (in this case, INLA should complain, I'll check that out). which
should explain the results.

thanks to Finn.L, who made me aware of this

H

